What is Dynamic Programming ?

ans : - Dynamic Programming = Recursion + Repeated Subproblems ko save karna
DP tab useful hoti hai jab kisi problem mein:-
Overlapping Subproblems ho
Optimal Substructure ho

Definition :- Dynamic Programming is a computer science and mathematical technique used
              to solve complex problems by breaking them down into simpler subproblems,
              solving each subproblem only once, and storing the results to avoid redundant work.